The openpgp-card-tools package provides a set of command-line utilities for
interacting with OpenPGP cards. It supports common operations such as
listing card information, managing PINs, generating keys, and performing
cryptographic operations directly on the hardware.

The primary tool, 'oct', serves as a versatile interface for administrative
tasks and user-level card management, ensuring secure handling of private
keys stored on OpenPGP-compliant smart cards and security tokens.
